{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_01",
      "hash": "acbacb1c0639952b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是一个认真尽职的警卫！\\n哎呀……有点口渴啊！\\r\\n好想喝[VAR COLOR(0006)]茶[VAR COLOR(0000)]啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_05",
      "hash": "acbacf1c06399bf7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂喂！\\n那边现在禁止通行！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_02",
      "hash": "acbacc1c063996de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，那茶\\n看上去很好喝啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_03",
      "hash": "acbacd1c06399891",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯？要送给我？\\n…………谢了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_06",
      "hash": "acbad01c06399daa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咕噜咕噜……\\n咕噜咕噜……\\c\\n如果想去咕噜咕噜……\\n金黄市的话咕噜咕噜……\\r\\n你就过去吧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_07",
      "hash": "acbad11c06399f5d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "记得去把茶也分给\\n另一边入口的警卫哦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0610_guard_04",
      "hash": "acbace1c06399a44",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊……\\n之前真是谢谢你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0610_middlef_01",
      "hash": "57fbeefe05e4976b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我送给警卫的深灰米果\\n好像是有点多了……\\c\\n看来如果没有茶的话，\\n它似乎特别不好下咽呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0610_middlef_02",
      "hash": "57fbeffe05e4991e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然吃深灰米果时，\\n一定要喝热茶来配呢！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0610_max",
      "hash": "69281b43b007f0a4"
    }
  ]
}
